# Authoring setup at the repo root. `npm install @opentestbed/...` creates the
# first three, and `otb-gherkin dialects` / `otb-gherkin compile` write the
# rest. None of it belongs in the repository, but all of it has to be allowed
# to exist here so that getting started needs no ceremony.
